#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:73
msgid ""
"Adjust the number of trees generated in forest polygons. This setting "
"affects performance."
msgstr ""
"Chanjya an niver a wedh dinythys yn furvow koos. An settyans ma a venn "
"gwrythyans."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:49
msgid "Automatically download incomplete multipolygons"
msgstr "Iskarga yn awtomatek liesfurvow andhien"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/validator/SpatialConsistencyChecks.java:177
msgid ""
"Building height ({0}m) and calculated part height ({1}m) differ significantly"
msgstr ""
"Ughelder drehevyans ({0}m) ha ughelder rann kalkys ({1}m) yw dihaval yn "
"arwedhek"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/validator/SpatialConsistencyChecks.java:163
msgid "Building is not fully covered by its parts"
msgstr "Drehevyans nyns yw gorherys yn leun gans an rannow"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/validator/SpatialConsistencyChecks.java:42
msgid ""
"Building outline should be fully covered by parts. Parts should not be "
"orphans. Note this test may show false positives on incomplete data"
msgstr ""
"Furv dhrehevyans a godh gorherys yn leun gans rannow. Rannow ny godh "
"omdhivasow. Notyewgh an prov ma a yll diskwedhes posedhegyon fals war dhata "
"andhien"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/validator/TagChecks.java:137
msgid "Building part without height"
msgstr "Rann dhrehevyans heb ughelder"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/validator/TagChecks.java:41
msgid "Checks for tag validity for buildings and building parts."
msgstr "Checkya rag komposter tagg rag drehevyansow ha rannow drehevyans."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:121
msgid "Configure rendering options for the 3D Viewer."
msgstr "Selya dewisyow rendrans rag an welell 3D."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/validator/OverlappingWallsCheck.java:26
msgid "Detects overlapping 3D walls that cause Z-fighting."
msgstr "Helerghi fosow 3D ow korgudha ow kawsya Z-omladh."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:43
msgid "Enable Ambient Occlusion Mode"
msgstr "Bywhe Fordh Lettyans Kerghynnek"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:37
msgid "Enable wireframe rendering mode"
msgstr "Bywhe fordh rendrans gwiverfram"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/josmactions/ToggleFakeAOAction.java:15
msgid "Fake AO"
msgstr "LK Fug"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:66
msgid "Forest density"
msgstr "Dosedh koos"

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:47
msgid "If checked, a fake ambient occlusion effect will be applied."
msgstr "Mar checkys, effeyth lettyans kerghynnek fug a vydh gweythys."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:65
msgid ""
"If checked, active satellite imagery will be used in 3D ground plane when "
"available. If unchecked, plugin's own 2D style will be used to render flat "
"objects."
msgstr ""
"Mar checkys, imajys lorell byw a vydh devndyhys yn playn dor 3D mars yw "
"kavadow. Mars ancheckys, an gis 2D a'n ystynnans a vydh devnydhys rag rendra "
"taklow platt."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:41
msgid ""
"If checked, buildings will be rendered as outlines instead of solid polygons."
msgstr "Mar checkys, drehevyansow a vydh rendrys gwag yn-dar solyd."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:59
msgid ""
"If checked, the number of objects, faces and frame time will be displayed in "
"the top-left corner."
msgstr ""
"Mar checkys, an niver a daklow, bejethow ha termyn fram a vydh diskwedhys "
"y'n korn a-wartha hag a-gledh."

#: src/main/java/ru/zkir/urbaneye3d/UrbanEye3dPreferences.java:53
msgid ""
"If checked, the plugin will attempt to download missing members of "
"multipolygons."
msgstr ""
"Mar checkys, an ystynnans a wra assaya iskarga eseli kellys a liesfurvow."

